        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Astbury, George Thorogood, Bill Graham\n- Events: A Gathering of the Tribes\n- Products: The Dirty Dozen\n- Organizations: George Thorogood and the Destroyers\n\nFacts:\n- George Thorogood was born on February 24, 1950, and he is an American musician, singer, and songwriter from Wilmington, Delaware.\n- Ian Astbury was born on May 14, 1962, and he is an English singer and songwriter.\n- A Gathering of the Tribes was a two-day music and culture festival held in California in October 1990, and Ian Astbury and promoter Bill Graham organized it.\n- The Dirty Dozen is the fourteenth studio album by blues rock artist George Thorogood and the Destroyers.",
